{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384167-list-of-cadet-houses","id":1384167,"title":"List of Cadet Houses?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-27T05:07:44-07:00","id":1384167,"title":"List of Cadet Houses?","content":"So I really liked how Heirs of the Shogunate have described the role of Cadet Houses as local/minor powers of the Realm politics, and I wondered id there is some detailed list of all Cadet Houses from previous editions, or at least were I could fins them. I know that Ferem has been around since, I think, 1e, but I am not sure about any other Houses which are yet to show up in 3e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T08:25:58-07:00","id":1384193,"title":"","content":"Manosque is mentioned in 2e in Scroll of Exalts (Infernals section). Might not be exactly what you're looking for, but it is a non-Great House.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/10wrFXvyXnNjaFJ0XrHdIwce6rnG__0k9/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Sidereal Jumpstart</a> (3e fanwork Charmset)<br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DQXwMXm8G1IEYLl-SmuFgKGugeZxQL63/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Cascades</a> (the above in flowchart form)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1103-tikor","name":"Tikor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1103_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"826"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T10:25:40-07:00","id":1384217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384167-list-of-cadet-houses#post1384167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I really liked how Heirs of the Shogunate have described the role of Cadet Houses as local/minor powers of the Realm politics, and I wondered id there is some detailed list of all Cadet Houses from previous editions, or at least were I could fins them. I know that Ferem has been around since, I think, 1e, but I am not sure about any other Houses which are yet to show up in 3e.</div> </div> </div> </div>3e is actually the first time we got like, any information on cadet houses. Even Ferem, while mentioned in passing in previous editions, kind of got forgotten about/never gotten to. In 1e they were going to get more in <b>Bastions of the North</b> but got axed when it came about, and in 2e they just got some info in teh 2e DB book but kind of again, not ever talked about after that. The books themselves were not even clear what made a cadet house different form a patrician one, from a minor one.<br /> <br /> Basically in short, what we have is what is there, more or less.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T12:16:05-07:00","id":1384236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384167-list-of-cadet-houses?p=1384217#post1384217\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 3e is actually the first time we got like, any information on cadet houses. Even Ferem, while mentioned in passing in previous editions, kind of got forgotten about/never gotten to. In 1e they were going to get more in <b>Bastions of the North</b> but got axed when it came about, and in 2e they just got some info in teh 2e DB book but kind of again, not ever talked about after that. The books themselves were not even clear what made a cadet house different form a patrician one, from a minor one.<br /> <br /> Basically in short, what we have is what is there, more or less.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see- than 3e did great job with developing that concept!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T14:52:46-07:00","id":1384273,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tikor</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384167-list-of-cadet-houses?p=1384193#post1384193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Manosque is mentioned in 2e in Scroll of Exalts (Infernals section). Might not be exactly what you're looking for, but it is a non-Great House.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually Manosque has been around since the 1E Storyteller's companion. A bit more on them there","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T16:05:09-07:00","id":1384289,"title":"","content":"I\u2019m unsure of the differences between cadet houses, patrician families and bloodlines or what the interplay between them is politically?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/669-hermes12","name":"Hermes12","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar669_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T16:15:12-07:00","id":1384294,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hermes12</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384167-list-of-cadet-houses?p=1384289#post1384289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m unsure of the differences between cadet houses, patrician families and bloodlines or what the interplay between them is politically?</div> </div> </div> </div>And if I may add to this question, could anyone tell me about some of the more powerful patrician families, and where I could find information about them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T17:17:12-07:00","id":1384303,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384167-list-of-cadet-houses?p=1384294#post1384294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And if I may add to this question, could anyone tell me about some of the more powerful patrician families, and where I could find information about them?</div> </div> </div> </div>That be the Realm, mentioned in the write ups of the Thousand Scales. I think the biggest one is Bel? I think that's how its written.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T18:40:28-07:00","id":1384323,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hermes12</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384167-list-of-cadet-houses?p=1384289#post1384289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I\u2019m unsure of the differences between cadet houses, patrician families and bloodlines or what the interplay between them is politically?</div> </div> </div> </div>Cadet houses are houses that rule kingdoms in the Threshold. By the Empress's decree no great house can directly rule a satrapy. The only two things the satrap is officially allowed to do is ensure that the Immaculate Order is the dominant/exclusive religion in the area, and that they pay their tribute on time. What that means is that the local ruling class who was in charge before the kingdom was lined to the Realm, by diplomacy or conquest, might get to keep ruling if they play nice with their new overlords. If that ruling family was Dragonblooded, or marries into Dragonblooded they may be deemed a cadet house.<br /> <br /> Otherwise a section of Realm loyal Dragonblooded might somehow split off to replace the rulers/marry into them and creat a cadet house that way.<br /> <br /> The Cadet houses are nobility by Realm standards, most of them share in some part the blood of the Empress. So they're treated by the great houses as kinda lame poor country bumpkin cousins who have some strange exotic customs. Cadet houses get to look down their nose at everyone who isn't from a great house, which is 99% of people.<br /> <br /> <br /> The patrician families on the other hand are mostly mortal, with very few exceptions, and they're more noble than peasants, but not quite actual royalty like a exalted house is. They're given connections and privileges that peasants aren't, and are there to act as a bridge between mortals and the exalted, as well as heft the mighty load of bureaucracy and logistics that are beneath the Dynasts to consider. It ends up lending them deceptive power that a lot of people forget exists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T18:41:20-07:00","id":1384325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Iceblade44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384167-list-of-cadet-houses?p=1384303#post1384303\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That be the Realm, mentioned in the write ups of the Thousand Scales. I think the biggest one is Bel? I think that's how its written.</div> </div> </div> </div>Cadet Houses are legally Dynasts. They\u2019re just based in the Threshold rather than the Great Houses on the Isle. Mostly they originate as Threshold DB fbloodlines that formed marriage alliances with Great Houses to secure territorial power under Realm rule.<br /> <br /> Patricians are the lesser nobility of the Blessed Isle. Most DBs born Patricians get adopted into a Great House after they Exalt, which results in a large payout to the Patrician family from the adopting Great House (this is as opposed to Commoner DBs, who cannot be adopted by a Great House without explicit permission from the Empress, and choose the Razor or Coin). There are a few exceptions of Patrician DBs who maintained their original family identity and rose to prominence, like the head of the Treasury.<br /> <br /> Threshold Bloodlines of DBs have no legally recognized political status in the Dynasty unless the family is elevated to Cadet House.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 04-27-2020, 09:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-27T18:54:43-07:00","id":1384334,"title":"","content":"On Patrician families, they have a lot of different origins. Some are descended from Shogunate Gentes that were never incorporated into a Great House, others are nouveau riche mortals, and some are descended from fallen Dynastic Houses stripped of the status (hence Patricians with family names like Manosque or Iselsi). But the most common origin for new Patrician Houses is that a Lost Egg who took the coin settles down and starts a family after their military service. A man might wed into an established Patrician House, but a woman, even if her husband is an established Patrician, is the matriarch of a new Patrician household.<br /> <br /> (Lost Egg/Dynast marriages generally involve the adoption of the Lost Egg into the House regardless of gender, but those all had to be individually approved by the Empress as the \u201cmatriarch\u201d of all Lost Eggs. Last time a bunch got adopted it was in the formation of House V\u2019neef)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-30T07:35:17-07:00","id":1384839,"title":"","content":"Oh, and just for completeness sake- what about canon Fallen Houses? I know about Jurul, Jerah, Manosque and Akiyo (as well as Prasad's Clans). Is there any more information about other Houses which fell from imperial grace?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-30T07:47:35-07:00","id":1384842,"title":"","content":"In 2nd ed there was House Chanos, after whom the port of Chanos on the Realm's Northern Coast was named.<br /> I don't remember seeing any mention of them in 3rd ed though.<br /> <br /> There's also, of course, House Iselsi, but I imagine you thought of them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-30T07:59:02-07:00","id":1384844,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384167-list-of-cadet-houses?p=1384842#post1384842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In 2nd ed there was House Chanos, after whom the port of Chanos on the Realm's Northern Coast was named.<br /> I don't remember seeing any mention of them in 3rd ed though.<br /> <br /> There's also, of course, House Iselsi, but I imagine you thought of them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Apparently they are mentioned in 3e- in the Realm, one of the possible origins for the Chanos Flicker is a Getimian from a removed reality in which Chanos were never removed from the imperial ledgers. Thanks for reminding me of them!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-30T10:20:07-07:00","id":1384868,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384167-list-of-cadet-houses?p=1384842#post1384842\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In 2nd ed there was House Chanos, after whom the port of Chanos on the Realm's Northern Coast was named.<br /> I don't remember seeing any mention of them in 3rd ed though.<br /> <br /> There's also, of course, House Iselsi, but I imagine you thought of them.</div> </div> </div> </div>And reminder that in 3e, while many Iselsi live under false names, or secretly in other Dynastic Houses having maintained a hidden ancestral identity, etc etc - there is a Patrician family living openly as Iselsi at the House of Black Waters in the Incas Prefecture. As far as the rest of the Dynasty is concerned - that\u2019s what remains of the fallen Great House.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-05T09:12:43-07:00","id":1385846,"title":"","content":"So on the subject of House Chanos- I have looked for a reference about them in 2e (Manual of Exalted Power- Dragon Blooded and Compas of Celestial Directions- Blessed Isle), but I haven't found any. Could anyone direct me to where they were mentioned?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-05T10:26:11-07:00","id":1385865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1384167-list-of-cadet-houses?p=1385846#post1385846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So on the subject of House Chanos- I have looked for a reference about them in 2e (Manual of Exalted Power- Dragon Blooded and Compas of Celestial Directions- Blessed Isle), but I haven't found any. Could anyone direct me to where they were mentioned?</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Exalted: the Dragon-Blooded</i> (first edition), p. 59, is the only prior reference I'm aware of.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":1120,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","user":"Eric Minton","date":". 05-05-2020, 01:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https:/